{"headword":"מִסְגֶּ֫רֶת","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. 1. border, rim. 2. fastness</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:27\" href=\"/Exodus.25.27\">Ex 25:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:14\" href=\"/Exodus.37.14\">37:14</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:25\" href=\"/Exodus.25.25\">25:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:12\" href=\"/Exodus.37.12\">37:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְגַּרְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:25\" href=\"/Exodus.25.25\">25:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:12\" href=\"/Exodus.37.12\">37:12</a>; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְגְּרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.28\">1 K 7:28</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְגְּרֹתֶיהָ</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:35\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.36\">36</a>, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>border, rim</em> (enclosure), of sacred table in tabern. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:25\" href=\"/Exodus.25.25\">Ex 25:25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:27\" href=\"/Exodus.25.27\">27</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:12\" href=\"/Exodus.37.12\">37:12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:14\" href=\"/Exodus.37.14\">14</a>; of bases of the sea, in temple <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:28-29\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.28-29\">1 K 7:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:32\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:35\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.36\">36</a> (cf. Benz), also <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.17\">2 K 16:17</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>fastness</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיַחְרְגוּ מִמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:46\" href=\"/Psalms.18.46\">ψ 18:46</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:46\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.46\">2 S 22:46</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָרַג\" href=\"/BDB,_חָרַג\", dir=\"rtl\">חרג</a>) <em>and they shall come quaking out of their fastnesses</em>, so <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:17\" href=\"/Micah.7.17\">Mi 7:17</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְגְּזוּ</span>, like reptiles), all of nations, in awe of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB06654","strong_numbers":["4526"],"next_hw":"סגר","prev_hw":"מַסְגֵּר²","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4995"],"TWOT":["1462d"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}